{"server":"cn","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_04_end","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_04","title":"缺席的人","storyCode":"CV-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"adb176d2135b14fbf3758ed9248095de191fd5c18be8828f4d2551fdead66a98","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪她展开双臂，将我拥入怀♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪从此她的双臂间，盛满我的家与梦♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得你们当时就这么聚在一起唱歌，唱得可真响亮啊......感觉那年冬日的雾气就是被你们的歌声驱散的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海伦娜女士，他们当时唱的就是刚刚这首歌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，不止不止，他们会的歌可多了，矿厂里的矿工来自各地，用各种语言唱各地的歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......伍德洛先生也会唱歌吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不怎么开口，大家聚在一起的时候，他要么喝酒，要么就像现在一样，埋头只顾吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......海伦娜，把我带回来的那瓶香槟开了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，看我这记性，差点忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，迈尔斯先生他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，他说去吹吹风，那就是吹吹风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们先把香槟打开，给他倒上一满杯，等他回来再让他喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就开了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"瓶塞砰的一声弹射出去，金黄色的酒液和银白色的泡沫同时喷溅而出。随之而出的甜蜜酒香在室内蔓延，桌上众人的眼神不禁有些迷离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给，杰西卡，你是今天的主角，第一杯先给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后是你，伍迪，多谢你帮杰西卡劝动了这头死犟死犟的驮兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这杯是迈尔斯的......这杯是我的......你的在最后，里昂，因为这么多人都替你操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该的，应该的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，我其实——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么话你也该等迈尔斯回来再说，哪有你在屋子里感谢大家，倒把他一个人扔在外面的道理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说得是，说得是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"喧闹了一整晚的餐桌一时间安静下来，洒到桌上的香槟在看不见的暗处静静流淌。\n流过碗碟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼，怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"流过杯盘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实......我有些话想和大家说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就说你小子今天怎么这么拘谨，原来酝酿了半天，是想抢你老爸在酒桌上的风头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼，你的话不等迈尔斯回来再说吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"流过空空的酒瓶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我觉得，现在这样就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一直流到桌边，滴在地上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"啪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我打算离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，原来是嫌我们这些老家伙吵了。本尼，稍等一会儿，等迈尔斯回来，我们最后喝一轮，道个别——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我是说，我打算离开达维镇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这小子，滴酒未沾就醉了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我很清醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚就一直想说......但是，再没机会了，我只能现在说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么了？你们怎么突然这副样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迈尔斯，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼刚刚说要......离开达维镇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从什么时候开始这么想的，本尼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一年前我就在这么想了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上个月，隔壁的赛琳娜女士找到我，说她在铸铁城的女儿找到了愿意途经此地的商队，她打算随着商队到女儿身边去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她问我愿不愿意同她一起离开，她觉得我很有天赋，在这里，它没法兑现。就算兑现，未来也无从施展。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她说......她不想看着我变成下一个西尔维娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生活费和学费怎么办？住的地方呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都不用操心，铸铁城已经有几所寄宿中学愿意让我在那里就学，同时提供奖学金。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼，这么大的决定，你怎么现在才和我们商量......这不该啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，迈尔斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迈尔斯，他没在和我们商量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是把他的决定说给我们听，只是这样而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是你深思熟虑后的决定吗，本尼？或许恢复航行后，地块上的情况就能好转，等到那个时候再做决定也不迟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想等了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们之所以愿意等待，笃信事情会有转机，是因为你们的记忆中有过这里最美好的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我没有，从我记事起......这里就已经是一团糟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的养父为了这里苦苦挣扎，不惜投入生活中的一切，我的兄长代替他支撑家庭，将将成年便加入佣兵队赚钱补贴家用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年后......那些人把他的遗物寄回来，附上的信中没有任何解释，只有一句我们很遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他那时应该有更多选择的。我想......现在我也应该有......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你什么时候走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......明天。我不该拖到现在才说，可再不说......就没机会了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"男孩看向餐桌另一边的父亲，鼓起勇气想直视对方的眼睛，渴望从中看到怒不可遏与怨怼责难。\n那可以让他的内心少一点愧疚与煎熬。\n但他的父亲只是抱着头沉默，眼底只留一片茫然无措。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"里昂，你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没事......没事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"挺好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你应该去的......应该的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海伦娜拍了拍里昂的肩膀，而里昂只是机械地重复着几句表示赞成的话语，她不得不更重地推了里昂一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"海伦娜，没事，我没事......这都是应该的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我祝你一路顺利，珍重，孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_11"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"切城的鬼天气怎么就这么冷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我捡了点木头烧，你有没有好一点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看你缩成一团的样子，以前没有经历过这样的日子吧？唉，想不通，你家人怎么会愿意放你出来做佣兵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！你自己愿意的？理由呢？你和家里人闹崩了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......保护一些人，解决一些问题。嗯，听起来是个挺崇高的理想，实话说，让我有点羡慕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出现在这片战场、这片废墟的大多数人，包括我在内，都是被推上来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被贫穷、不义、黑暗与暴力教唆，拿起武器，还没想好对准的到底是什么，就贸然开了火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到踩到一片泥泞，低头看向鞋印，里面却不是浑浊的泥水......而是一片血红。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个时候，有个崇高的念头在，可以保护你不被击垮。很可惜，我始终没有找到......我就是为了钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我家里欠了很多钱，弟弟又是个顶聪明的小混蛋，他要是生在富贵人家，能当高材生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可养在我们家......就只能当讨债鬼了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......这不算是为了钱。为了家人......也是很值得尊敬的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......或许吧，但现在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们都只是为了活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"进攻又开始了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂，别喝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......今晚我可以留在餐厅吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是愿意，就待在这里好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）他这个样子......唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）和七年前一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......是要讲卡尔吗？不用避着我，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经是第二次了......第二次了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两次了......避着我干什么？我还能......受不了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g1_mine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡小姐，多谢你送我到这里。你可以回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......我还是放心不下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你总花心思在我们身上，我猜你的老板不会高兴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......看到了就做不到旁观......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么说，你帮助爸爸保住了房子，谢谢你，杰西卡小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可里昂先生他愿意出售股份的原因......其实是你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，杰西卡小姐，为了给我留个能够遮风挡雨的地方，他不得不卖了矿厂的股份。可要是没有我，他就能选择他真正想要的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在他追求的东西面前，房子不是阻碍，我和哥哥才是阻碍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还记得我的哥哥吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说......卡尔？我只知道你和海伦娜当时提起过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡尔是他的名字，我们以此称呼他......不过你们黑钢同事的话，应该更常叫他的代号——精铁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......精铁？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂，都是过去的事了，何苦旧事重提呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用劝他，迈尔斯，让他说下去。他之前不愿意想，我们就不提。现在他想回过头看看，那我们也陪着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不愿意想......但夜深人静，我的脑子想还是不想，我自己还能控制得了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我越想越痛苦，越痛苦越是想不出个所以然......可本尼早就想明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他说得对，卡尔走的每一步都别无选择，因为我太固执，我太自大，我把钱，把生活，把他的选择......全都透支掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小时候，有位矿工和我抱怨过，人到中年，什么都不容易，精力有限，只能专注在为数不多的几件事上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以要慎重，千万别贪心，盯紧最重要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可轮到我上了岁数，我无论如何都不愿服老，抓着错误的绳端还不肯放手，还觉得自己在做勇敢的斗士，与命运殊死相争......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我争到了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我争到了一屁股债务，争到了一个马上就要完蛋的达维镇，争得我的大儿子死在战场上，二儿子看透了这一点，不得不从我身边逃开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"里昂，大家都明白矿厂对你意味着什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意味着什么？它到底意味着什么？我不知道，迈尔斯，我现在更不知道了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我现在只知道，我那时最应该抓住的是一双手啊......应该是我孩子的手啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真是个傻瓜啊，当时我怎么就......没想起来那句抱怨话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......本该牢牢地、深深地、死死地把这句话刻在脑子里......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g1_mine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我爸爸是个记性很差的糊涂蛋，但我不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见到你们第一眼我就认出来了，你们制服和武器上的标志，和卡尔的遗物袋上面的那个一模一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他、他是你的哥哥......我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不知道他的真名？还是......你干脆不记得他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得的......我们共事的时间不长......但我记得他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和卡尔共事过......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在切城，我们被一同留下来侦察藏在废墟中的敌方力量......他受伤时我在场，我、我当时很慌乱，大脑一片空白，我、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡尔死时你就在场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你却不知道他的真名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，我本来也不是想说这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想问，你有没有见过一枚银色的，有几颗碎钻的戒指？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是他的亲生母亲给他的，他一直带在身上，你们公司寄来的遗物袋里却没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你看着他死去......那你一定知道它去哪里了......是你们谁拿走了吗？那是我哥哥的东西，还给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我、我不知道，没有，戒指不在他身上......我没见过，可能是丢了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......卡尔怎么可能把那枚戒指弄丢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g4_bank"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无聊的银行员工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"终于处理完最后一个了......让我看看......嗬，一百二十号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷淡的银行员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"只是动动纸笔，就往拓荒地送了一百二十个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"无聊的银行员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，不动这个纸笔，下一个去拓荒地的就是你我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷淡的银行员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"西尔维娅，关灯就交给你，我要赶紧回去躺着了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一百二十个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"焦虑与担忧让西尔维娅习惯性地伸出手在衣领处摸索，她一触到胸口前熟悉的圆环，便迅速将它紧紧攥住。\n圆环坚硬的质地硌得她手心生疼，却让她的心情慢慢平复下来。\n就像七年前那个拥抱，勒到她难以呼吸，却让她汹涌的眼泪逐渐停息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡尔......我该怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还能......做些什么呢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g7_sonwydowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你也不知道戒指的下落......回去吧，杰西卡小姐，送到这里就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我真的很感激你让爸爸选择了房子，这样的话......我选择离开，他也不会一无所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些股份除了让他觉得好过之外，真的没有用，一点用也没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如、如果......里昂先生最终没有保住房子，你、你也会走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道，我不想当执拗的傻瓜，也不想......当个彻头彻尾的混蛋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再见了，杰西卡小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么还跟着我，杰西卡小姐？你还想做什么，你又能做些什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我不知道......我只是觉得......不应该就此离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧，算我求你，杰西卡小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你手里有颗金钉子，珍贵无比，但......不要再拿你这颗金钉子去补这里的纸屋子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何努力，最终你留给它的，只会是几个漏风的孔洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薄薄的纸张，承不住它的重量的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到你描金绘银的家吧，找个缝隙把那颗钉子钉上去，那才是它真正该在的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，别跟着我了，好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g1_mine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"本尼已经回去了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......伍德洛先生啊。我看着他回家的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你为什么不回去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去也睡不着，想一个人待一会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那小子到底和你说什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说了些......非常有道理的话，提醒了我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一些事实，一些我早该在心里明确的事实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......从小到大，对他人伸出援手，就像从清澈的浴缸水里捞取小黄羽兽玩具一样。只需要伸手，我就能阻止它被水淹没。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......那只是因为，权势与金钱为我打造的水龙头里，只会流出清澈的温水，所以我周围的一切看起来澄澈透明、干净清晰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可一旦走出那个叫做“家族”的浴缸，我才意识到......现实......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......现实是一片浑浊的泥潭，你伸手进去，会捞出什么，会摸到什么，一概不得而知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不该为此纠结的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说句难听话，你做的事情，远达不到能够左右本尼的决定的程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看着那孩子长大，他从小不仅有主意，而且主意正，他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他和我认识的一个人很像，深思熟虑后，认准了一个方向，从此再也不会往身后看一眼，命中仅剩前路，不留退路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来......是很坚决的人，也很不理智。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，他是非常理智的人，在我们之中最早意识到了这个道理：一切困惑的源头，一切问题的答案，只能在前路中寻找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......有点羡慕那样的人，能够那么早领会，应该可以避免掉很多不必要的烦恼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"千万不要羡慕那样的人，杰西卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......为什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为他们最终都会秃掉，一根头发也不剩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢你的安慰，伍德洛先生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["杰西卡"]}]}
